flowchart TD
    A["Register exact source version and physical pages"] --> B{"Required treatment"}
    B -->|Overview| C["Extract text if useful; quick-read in batches"]
    C --> D["Save excerpts, page map and exact coverage"]
    D --> E["Extract provisional observations"]
    D --> F["Queue priority passages and unread remainder"]
    B -->|Critical or uncertain passage| F
    F --> G{"Host allowance available?"}
    G -->|No| H["Checkpoint until next budget window"]
    H --> F
    G -->|Yes| I["Reserve a bounded page batch"]
    I --> J["Read original pages in detail"]
    J --> K["Save immutable run and settle actual usage"]
    K --> L["Reassess observations and affected conclusions"]
    E --> L
    K --> M{"Useful work remains?"}
    M -->|Yes| F
    M -->|No| N["Checkpoint"]
